    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Look, there's a present at your doorstep! Somebody must have left it for you -- but what could it be...?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Chapter 2 of Wood and Flesh: A Candleforth Story,</strong> a <strong>point &amp; click puzzle</strong> adventure with <strong>hand-drawn 2D graphics</strong> that tells the <strong>first part of a new story</strong> set in the <strong><i>Tales from Candleforth</i></strong> universe. The Tales from Candleforth is a book that collects traditional tales from this peculiar place; but someone... or something... is bringing these tales to real lifem, mixing them with the worst nightmares you can imagine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this new chapter of the unsettling (but cozy) horror universe of Tales from Candleforth, taking inspiration from the dark children's folklore tales of yore.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Look, there's a present at your doorstep! Somebody must have left it for you -- but what could it be...?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Chapter 2 of Wood and Flesh: A Candleforth Story,</strong> a <strong>point &amp; click puzzle</strong> adventure with <strong>hand-drawn 2D graphics</strong> that tells the <strong>first part of a new story</strong> set in the <strong><i>Tales from Candleforth</i></strong> universe. The Tales from Candleforth is a book that collects traditional tales from this peculiar place; but someone... or something... is bringing these tales to real lifem, mixing them with the worst nightmares you can imagine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this new chapter of the unsettling (but cozy) horror universe of Tales from Candleforth, taking inspiration from the dark children's folklore tales of yore.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "A new story in the Tales from Candleforth universe. Continue the story of Wood and Flesh: A Candleforth Short Story in this new chapter, in a point &amp; click puzzle adventure with hand-drawn 2D graphics and an unsettling cozy horror setting.",
